# Source and documentation are normalised to LF in the repository, whatever the checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The macro fixtures are compared byte for byte, and a 0x0D or 0x0A inside a macro line is data.
# Without this, end-of-line normalisation would silently rewrite them on checkout.
*.dat binary
*.ttl binary
*.sys binary
*.exe binary
*.png binary
